# .Rbuildignore — BisonExplorR
#
# Patterns are PERL-style regular expressions matched against paths relative to
# the package root, and they are NOT anchored automatically. Always write
# ^name$ for a top-level file or folder: a bare `docs` would also match
# `inst/tutorials/docs-demo`, and a bare `exams` would match anything with
# "exams" in the path.
#
# THE TEST FOR THIS FILE: if a student seeing it via system.file() would be a
# problem, it does not belong in the installed package. Everything under inst/
# installs and is reachable. This file is the only thing standing between the
# repo and the student-inspectable package.
#
# ⚠️ .Rbuildignore controls what ships in the BUILT PACKAGE. It has no effect
# on what is visible in a public GitHub repository. If the repo is public,
# exams/ and coach-endpoint/ are public regardless of the lines below.

# --- Never ship: instructor-controlled and secret-adjacent -------------------
# Real exams, answer keys, and their CSVs.
^exams$
# The Coach proxy. plumber.R BUILDS THE COACH'S SYSTEM PROMPT, so shipping it
# would hand students the exact Socratic constraints and the phrasing that gets
# around them. exercise_registry.R travels with it.
^coach-endpoint$
# Probes, preflight scripts, and state-probe .Rmd files. Anything placed in
# inst/tutorials/ appears in students' Tutorial pane; dev/ is where those live
# instead.
^dev$
# The public demo app bundle. Deployed to shinyapps.io, not part of the package.
^demo-app$

# --- Never ship: environment and credentials --------------------------------
# The graded-mode flag belongs in the DEPLOYED APP BUNDLE only. If a .Renviron
# setting BISONEXPLORR_GRADED=true reaches the package, every practice copy
# starts logging.
^\.Renviron$
^\.Renviron\..*$
^.*\.Rprofile$

# --- pkgdown -----------------------------------------------------------------
^_pkgdown\.yml$
^docs$
^pkgdown$

# --- Git, CI, and editor cruft ----------------------------------------------
^\.github$
^\.git$
^\.gitignore$
^\.gitattributes$
^\.travis\.yml$
^codecov\.yml$
^appveyor\.yml$

# --- RStudio / R session artefacts ------------------------------------------
^.*\.Rproj$
^\.Rproj\.user$
^\.Rhistory$
^\.RData$
^\.Ruserdata$
^\.DS_Store$
^.*desktop\.ini$

# --- Project bookkeeping (useful in the repo, meaningless in the package) ----
^BisonExplorR_project_seed\.md$
^DATASET_REGISTRY\.md$
^PROJECT_SYNC.*\.md$
^.*_RUNBOOK\.md$
^.*checklist.*\.md$
^COACH_INTEGRATION\.md$
^COACH_PILOT_README\.md$
^tutorial_inlab_audit\.md$

# --- Deliberately NOT ignored ------------------------------------------------
# README.md   -> ships, and is the pkgdown home page
# NEWS.md     -> ships, and is the pkgdown changelog
# LICENSE     -> required
# inst/       -> tutorials, labs, extdata, practice-exams all ship BY DESIGN
